<?php
return ['name' => 'empowered_ren_water_the_visionary', 'displayTitle' => ['en' => 'Empowered Ren Water – The Visionary', 'zh' => '身强壬水'], 'locales' => ['en' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Ren Water signifies mighty rivers and open oceans – vast, powerful, and always moving. When strongly empowered, Empowered Ren Water has sweeping vision and deep insight, often thinking on a grand scale and planning for the long term. Its growth comes from learning to channel that immense potential into steady forward motion.</p><p>Bold & Adventurous: You\'re naturally daring and confident. Once you set a goal, you charge towards it with strong execution and leader-like charisma. You aren\'t shy about taking risks – you often enjoy the thrill of new challenges.<br/>Quick-Witted: Your mind moves fast. You adapt to new situations on the fly and make snap decisions with ease. This mental agility is a huge asset, though your tongue can be just as quick.<br/>Strong-Willed Leader: Outwardly, you appear generous, broad-minded, and jovial. Yet you harbor a strong desire for control and have firm ideas about how things should go. You like to take charge of situations to ensure success.</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Wood, Fire, and Earth. Think of yourself as a powerful river: overflowing at times, or lacking direction if uncontained. Earth (like riverbanks and dams) gives you structure and accountability, so you don\'t spill your energy aimlessly. Fire adds warmth, enthusiasm, and guidance, acting like the sun that lifts water into nourishing rain – it boosts your motivation and sense of purpose. Wood provides channels for growth and creativity, like plants drinking from the river – it helps convert your ideas into living plans. By incorporating Wood, Fire, and Earth influences, you gain focus and responsibility, ensuring that your vast energy drives you toward meaningful goals and that your ambitions benefit both you and those around you.</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>Wealth</h4><p>Your clever, cross-disciplinary mind finds opportunities to make money in unexpected places. You\'re the type to spot a niche or trend before others and capitalize on it. However, the key for you is learning the art of consolidation afterwards – practice holding onto it by reigning in the impulse to perpetually chase the next big thing.</p><h4>Health</h4><p>Pay attention to your kidneys and hydration – don\'t skimp on sleep and go easy on substances that overtax your kidneys like excessive alcohol or caffeine. Joint health is another consideration: avoid extreme sedentary marathons. Regular movement, stretching, or yoga will help keep your knees, back, and hips in good shape.</p><h4>Emotional Wellbeing</h4><p>When you\'re steaming toward a goal and something throws up a roadblock, it can make you incredibly restless or irritable. To maintain emotional balance, you need healthy ways to release pressure. High-intensity workouts are one excellent choice. Another remedy can be strategy games or complex puzzles.</p><h4>Career Pathways</h4><p>Where You Flourish: Law & Strategic Finance: You do well in positions where big decisions are made. As a judge or attorney, you\'d fearlessly tackle major cases and shape outcomes. In finance, roles like senior auditor or tax strategist let you oversee and optimize large systems (budgets, portfolios) with your broad vision and decisive action. Energy & Engineering Projects: Large-scale engineering, urban planning, or energy sector projects are your playground. Whether it\'s heading a civil engineering team building bridges and highways, planning smart cities, or driving an oil, gas, or renewable energy initiative, you excel at orchestrating huge efforts. Your capacity to see the grand picture ensures infrastructure and energy projects benefit from your forward-thinking leadership. Technology & Manufacturing: High-tech industries suit your adaptive intellect. You could thrive as a software architect (especially in complex areas like system architecture or big data integration), or leading innovative manufacturing processes in electronics or automotive fields. You enjoy pushing the boundaries of what\'s possible and scaling up production or platforms in revolutionary ways. Creative Media & Communication: Your bold presence and persuasive vision can shine in media fields. Advertising campaigns, film directing, writing influential stories, journalism, or brand management are arenas where you can influence public perception and spearhead creative movements. You have the potential to become a trendsetter or thought leader, harnessing the power of media to change minds en masse. Transportation & Logistics: Managing large networks – be it an airline route system, a shipping fleet, or a global supply chain – is right up your alley. These fields tap into your love of complexity and scale. You can visualize the flow of goods or traffic like currents in a giant river and optimize them to run smoothly, ensuring that the big machine keeps moving efficiently. Public Administration & Leadership: Roles in government or as a high-ranking corporate executive fit naturally. Whether you\'re a city planner in a water resources department, a policy maker, or a CEO/project director, you\'re drawn to positions where you can implement large-scale changes and leave a legacy. Your ability to rally teams and outline grand strategies means you often end up steering organizations or initiatives to new heights. Where Energy Feels Drained: Routine Maritime Work: Oddly enough for a Water type, the day-to-day of fishing, aquaculture, or being a ship crew member may feel stifling. The repetitive, routine nature of these jobs doesn\'t engage your visionary mind – you need more variety and intellectual stimulation than casting nets or maintaining a boat schedule provides. Trade & Delivery: Roles in wholesale trade, basic import-export operations, or being a courier/logistics dispatcher could bore you over time. They involve a lot of procedural work and incremental gains, lacking the expansive growth or creative problem-solving you crave. Nightlife & Tourism: Running a bar, club, or working as a tour guide might sound fun (and you do have the sociable, adventurous side for it), but the erratic hours and transient interactions can disrupt the stability you need to direct your energy. Plus, these jobs might not fully utilize your strategic talents – they keep you in the moment rather than building something lasting. Solo Freelancing: While you value independence, being a long-term solo freelancer or gig worker could leave you feeling aimless or underutilized. Without a larger mission or team to lead, you might struggle with motivation or get frustrated at the limited scope. You shine brightest when you can captain a ship, not just row your own little boat – so consider collaborating or scaling up rather than working completely alone.</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Wu Earth friends help anchor your impulsiveness. These are the folks who will gently remind you to slow down, think things through, and not rush into every exciting new idea.</li><li>Bing Fire friends stoke your sense of purpose and add even more drive. Their optimism and passion are contagious, giving your natural boldness an extra focus and excitement.</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Wu Earth partner can be your rock. Their calm, pragmatic nature tempers your changeable moods and impatience. They excel at providing stability and give you a platform from which to launch your dreams safely.</li><li>Ding Fire lover introduces warmth and empathy that complement your occasionally cool rational side. They\'ll encourage you to open up emotionally and express the gentler feelings you might keep hidden.</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Bob Dylan: Nobel Prize-winning singer-songwriter and artist</li><li>Kevin Systrom: Co-founder of Instagram</li><li>Martin Luther King Jr.: Civil rights leader who pushed for the Civil Rights Act and advocated for non-violent resistance</li><li>Warren Buffett: Investment legend</li><li>Ludwig van Beethoven: Classical music master who composed the Ninth Symphony after losing his hearing</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Li Ziqi: Short video creator who spreads traditional Chinese farming culture and promotes international attention to intangible cultural heritage</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_dailytips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Add a touch of ceramic to your surroundings – for example, a ceramic cup for your coffee or tea, a terra cotta planter for a houseplant, or a decorative pottery piece on your shelf. These items carry the Earth element\'s stabilizing vibe, subtly reminding your rushing river of energy to slow down and \'water the soil\' (focus on groundwork) from time to time</li><li>Get more sunshine. Make a habit of stepping outside in the morning or during breaks to soak up natural light. Sunlight corresponds to Fire energy, which invigorates you and lifts your mood. Even on busy days, a ten-minute sunbath can recharge your batteries and dispel any cold, stagnant feelings. Over the long term, regular sunshine (with proper skin protection, of course) supports your circadian rhythm, helping you maintain steady energy levels to pursue your grand visions</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Yellow (Earth): Yellow is your go-to color for grounding and focus. It symbolizes trustworthiness and stability – qualities that keep your vast ambitions practical. Using a yellow notebook or sticky notes for your to-do lists can help turn lofty ideas into concrete plans. Wearing a shade of yellow, even if it\'s just hidden in a sock or tie, can subconsciously anchor you when you\'re feeling scattered. This hue instills a bit more patience and caution, which for you means the difference between a flood and a well-irrigated field.</li><li>Green & Teal (Wood): The colors of growth and open skies. For Empowered Ren Water, these tones expand your vision and boost communication, turning big ideas into flowing action. Add leafy greens, jade jewelry, or teal décor into your space to keep inspiration fresh and energy moving.</li><li>Red & Purple (Fire): These are power colors for you, fueling your passion and creativity. Red gives you drive and courage, while purple adds a dash of wisdom and nobility to your pursuits. Surround yourself with these colors when you need a motivational boost – perhaps a red wallpaper on your computer for a big project week, or a purple candle on your desk during brainstorming. They\'ll energize you and help translate your visions into decisive actions. In daily fashion, even a red phone case or a purple accessory can serve as a talisman of confidence and inspiration.</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Center (Earth): Focus on the center to cultivate better management and consistency in your life. For instance, consider doing important tasks or decision-making in the central area of your home or office. You might also benefit from positioning yourself centrally in your community or team – take on the coordinator role that brings people together. The energy of the center is about grounding and conserving, which helps you manage finances and resources more wisely (preventing that tendency to over-expand). By consciously \'centering\' yourself, you reinforce stability and sustainability for your ventures.</li><li>South (Fire): Align with the south for expansion and vitality. South is the direction of the midday sun, symbolizing peak energy and growth. If you\'re looking to broaden your business or skillset, facing south during meditation or work can invoke the feeling of spreading out and upward. You could arrange your office so that you face south when pitching ideas or making important calls – this is thought to amplify your enthusiasm and charisma. Decorating the southern part of your space with dynamic elements (like a moving sculpture or a bright light) can also activate opportunities. South\'s fiery boost will help you seize more chances and fuel your ever-ambitious drive, keeping you growing and thriving in the pursuit of your goals.</li></ul>']]], 'zh' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>壬水为江海奔腾之水，身强壬水具备宏大格局与洞察力，善于前瞻规划。身强壬水的修炼在于将澎湃的势能转化为可持续的动能。真正的强大，不在于摧毁堤岸，而在于既能奔腾入海，又能润泽良田，使力量既浩荡又有益于周围环境。</p><p>果敢强势：天性果敢，目标明确且执行力强，具备领袖气质与冒险精神。<br/>思维敏捷：适应力强，判断迅速，但需注意言语直率可能伤及他人。<br/>掌控欲强：外显豪迈慷慨，实则掌控欲强烈，面对挑战能展现惊人韧性。</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>身强壬水，喜用神为木、火、土。壬水如江河奔流，身强时力量充沛，但有时可能失控或方向不稳。若能借助土火木之力，就能增强责任感与执行力，让行动更有目标，同时稳健拓展事业与财富。</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>财富运势</h4><p>靠脑子灵活跨界赚钱，青年时期易有横财机遇，中年后需培养守成意识，避免因过度扩张破财。</p><h4>健康隐患</h4><p>注意肾脏代谢，避免长期熬夜与酗酒；保护关节健康；预防突发性头痛。</p><h4>情绪管理</h4><p>易因目标受阻产生焦躁情绪，可通过高强度运动、战略类游戏疏导能量。</p><h4>职业管理</h4><p>推荐行业：金融与法律业：法官、律师、审计师、税务师。能源与电力业：电力工程、石油化工、新能源。建筑与地产业：土木工程、城市规划、房地产开发。科技与制造业：程序员、电子半导体、机械制造。传媒与创意业：广告策划、导演、作家、记者、品牌管理。交通与物流业：航运管理、航空管制、物流供应链管理。公共事业与管理：公务员、企业高管、项目经理。慎重行业：水产与航运业：渔业、水产养殖、船员。贸易与流通业：批发、进出口贸易、快递。娱乐与旅游业：酒吧、夜店、导游。</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>戊土：沉稳务实的戊土可以约束你的冲动，帮助你沉淀能量，明确目标。</li><li>丙火：丙火能够激发你的行动魄力，让你更有目标感和执行力。</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>戊土：戊土稳重，能化解你的善变和急躁。</li><li>丁火：丁火能够调和你的冰冷理性，激发你细腻的情感表达。</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Bob Dylan：诺贝尔文学奖得主，唱作人艺术家</li><li>Kevin Systrom：Instagram联合创始人</li><li>Martin Luther King Jr.：民权运动领袖，推动《民权法案》通过，倡导非暴力抗争</li><li>Warren Buffett：股神</li><li>Ludwig van Beethoven：古典音乐巨匠，失聪后创作《第九交响曲》</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>李子柒：短视频创作者，传播中国传统农耕文化，推动非遗技艺国际关注</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_dailytips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>摆放陶瓷摆件</li><li>多晒太阳</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>黄色（土）：黄色象征稳固与根基，能增强责任意识，让壬水在面对事务时更踏实可靠。日常多用黄色小物件，让行动更有方向感。</li><li>红色 / 紫色（火）：红色代表热情与动力，紫色象征果敢与灵感，能激发行动力，让壬水在关键时刻更果断高效。适度加入红紫色元素，让计划顺利推进。</li><li>绿色 / 青色（木）：绿色有助于开阔思路，增强沟通能力，让身强壬水才华得以有效施展，避免因思虑过甚而行动不足。</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>中部（土）：中部的能量象征稳固与守成，有助于财务管理与积累，让壬水保持稳定。</li><li>南方（火）：南方的能量象征动力与扩展，利于拓展事业，让壬水在行动中获得更多机会与成长。</li></ul>']]]], 'version' => 1];
